===== Page 31 of 41 =====
Null space

• The control term C is in the null space of J



• The null space of J is the set of vectors
   which have no influence on the constraints




 ILE5030 Computer Animation and Special Effects 25S   31

===== Page 32 of 41 =====
Utility of Null Space

• The null space can be used to reach
   secondary goals



• Or to find natural pose / control stiffness of joints




 ILE5030 Computer Animation and Special Effects 25S   32

